      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%91u%C3%B1oa",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Teatro UC, formerly the Dante cinema, is a historic cultural venue on Plaza Ñuñoa.",
